NOTE ON CONTENT

This licence covers the SOFTWARE only.

It does not cover, and this repository must never contain:

  * Model UN conference material authored by a conference (background guides,
    rules documents, study packs). That material belongs to its authors and is
    not ours to redistribute.
  * A delegate's own prepared strategy — speeches, points of information,
    defence banks, country dossiers. Publishing those before a competition
    hands opponents the playbook.

Both categories are excluded by .gitignore, and `npm run check-publishable`
fails the build if either is ever staged.
